  "goodToKnow": "Der Aussteller is an exhibitor at a trade fair (Messe) and the issuer of a document: der Aussteller einer Rechnung, eines Zeugnisses. Germany hosts about two-thirds of the world's leading trade fairs, including the Hannover Messe, IFA in Berlin and the Frankfurt Book Fair. The verb ausstellen means to exhibit, to issue (einen Pass ausstellen) and colloquially to switch off. Plural: die Aussteller."
